WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:09.200
<v Narrator><i>Odysseus finishes his tale and the Phaeacians sit in silence.</i>

2
00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:25.770
<v Alcinous>Bring out one more chest, and let every lord of Phaeacia add a tripod and a cauldron to it. Then set the feast, for our guest sails at sundown and he must leave us glad.

3
00:00:25.820 --> 00:00:36.780
<v Narrator><i>At sunset Odysseus boards the convoy ship and lies on a prepared bed in the stern.</i>

4
00:00:36.830 --> 00:00:43.790
<v Narrator><i>The crew carries the sleeping man and his treasure onto the shore.</i>
